; Asuka, "Fingers of Fate" with Sonja's theme quoted from the ROM (NS2: the subtle mix, Sonja's tune only once, in the contrasting section). E harmonic minor, 124 bpm. Intro 4 bars, loop 32 bars. The notes are ours; Sonja's come from the player's ROM at run time.
song asuka
tempo 124
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst lead = A.27  shift=12
inst pad  = A.111 shift=-12
inst bass = A.36  shift=24
inst kit  = A.120
inst brs  = A.56  shift=-12
hit kick=36 rim=37 snare=40 hat=44 ohat=46 tom1=45 tom2=48 tom3=50 crash=49

track 1 inst=lead vol=90 pan=0   vel=116 gate=85 gain=0.95
track 2 inst=pad  vol=64 pan=-12 vel=100 gate=95 gain=0.54
track 3 inst=bass vol=96 pan=0   vel=118 gate=72 gain=2.08
track 4 inst=kit  vol=72 pan=0   vel=108 gate=100 gain=0.56
track 5 inst=brs  vol=84 pan=10  vel=108 gate=88 gain=1.51

def n1:
  | E4/16 G4/16 B4/16 G4/16 E4/16 G4/16 B4/16 C5/16 B4/16 G4/16 E4/16 G4/16 B4/16 C5/16 B4/16 G4/16 |
end
def n2:
  | A3/16 C4/16 E4/16 C4/16 A3/16 C4/16 E4/16 A4/16 E4/16 C4/16 A3/16 C4/16 E4/16 A4/16 E4/16 C4/16 |
end
def n3:
  | B3/16 D#4/16 F#4/16 D#4/16 B3/16 D#4/16 F#4/16 B4/16 F#4/16 D#4/16 B3/16 D#4/16 F#4/16 B4/16 F#4/16 D#4/16 |
end
def n4:
  | E4/16 G4/16 B4/16 G4/16 E4/16 G4/16 B4/16 G4/16 B4/4 C5/4 |
end
def n5:
  | C5/16 B4/16 A4/16 B4/16 G4/16 A4/16 F#4/16 G4/16 E4/16 F#4/16 D#4/16 E4/16 B3/16 C4/16 A3/16 B3/16 |
end
def n6:
  | E4/16 D#4/16 E4/16 B3/16 G4/16 F#4/16 G4/16 E4/16 B4/16 A4/16 B4/16 G4/16 C5/16 B4/16 C5/16 A4/16 |
end
def n8:
  | B4/4 G4/4 E4/2 |
end
def nl:
  | E3/16 G3/16 B3/16 G3/16 E3/16 G3/16 B3/16 C4/16 B3/16 G3/16 E3/16 G3/16 B3/16 C4/16 B3/16 G3/16 |
end
def c1:
  | E4/16 F4/16 F#4/16 G4/16 G#4/16 A4/16 A#4/16 B4/16 C5/16 B4/16 A#4/16 A4/16 G#4/16 G4/16 F#4/16 F4/16 |
end
def c2:
  | B3/16 C4/16 C#4/16 D4/16 D#4/16 E4/16 F4/16 F#4/16 G4/16 F#4/16 F4/16 E4/16 D#4/16 D4/16 C#4/16 C4/16 |
end
def cd:
  | A4/16 G#4/16 G4/16 F#4/16 F4/16 E4/16 D#4/16 D4/16 C#4/16 C4/16 B3/16 A#3/16 A3/16 G#3/16 G3/16 F#3/16 |
end
def kb:
  | kick/8 hat/8 snare/8 hat/8 kick/8 kick/8 snare/8 hat/8 |
end
def kc:
  | crash/8 hat/8 snare/8 hat/8 kick/8 kick/8 snare/8 hat/8 |
end
def kf:
  | kick/8 hat/8 snare/8 hat/8 tom1/16 tom1/16 tom2/16 tom2/16 tom3/16 tom3/16 snare/16 snare/16 |
end
def kq:
  | kick/4 rim/4 kick/4 rim/4 |
end
def kt:
  | kick/4. kick/4. kick/4 |
end

def n8x:
  | B4/4 G4/4 E4/2 |
end
def c3:
  | E4/16 G4/16 B4/16 C5/16 B4/16 G4/16 E4/16 G4/16 B4/16 C5/16 B4/16 G4/16 E4/16 G4/16 B4/16 C5/16 |
end
def rs:
  | r/1 |
end
def be:
  | E2/8 E2/8 E2/8 E2/8 E2/8 E2/8 E2/8 E2/8 |
end
def ba:
  | A2/8 A2/8 A2/8 A2/8 A2/8 A2/8 A2/8 A2/8 |
end
def bb:
  | B2/8 B2/8 B2/8 B2/8 B2/8 B2/8 B2/8 B2/8 |
end
def bc:
  | C3/8 C3/8 C3/8 C3/8 C3/8 C3/8 C3/8 C3/8 |
end
def hC:
  | C3/2 G2/2 |
end
def hG:
  | G2/2 D3/2 |
end
def hD:
  | D3/2 A2/2 |
end
def hE:
  | E2/2 B2/2 |
end
def hB:
  | B2/2 F#2/2 |
end
def aC:
  | C3/8 G3/8 C4/8 E4/8 G4/8 E4/8 C4/8 G3/8 |
end
def aG:
  | G3/8 D4/8 G4/8 B4/8 D5/8 B4/8 G4/8 D4/8 |
end
def aD:
  | D3/8 A3/8 D4/8 F#4/8 A4/8 F#4/8 D4/8 A3/8 |
end
def aE:
  | E3/8 B3/8 E4/8 G4/8 B4/8 G4/8 E4/8 B3/8 |
end
def aB:
  | B3/8 F#4/8 B4/8 D#5/8 B4/8 F#4/8 D#4/8 F#4/8 |
end
def v:
  | G4/2 E5/2 | | D5/2. B4/4 | | A4/2 F#5/2 | | G5/2. E5/4 |
  | E5/4. D5/8 C5/2 | | B4/4. A4/8 G4/2 | | F#4/2 D#5/2 | | E5/2 D#5/2 |
end
def v1:
  | G4/2 E5/2 | | D5/2. B4/4 | | A4/2 F#5/2 | | G5/2. E5/4 |
end
def kh:
  | kick/8 hat/8 hat/8 hat/8 snare/8 hat/8 hat/8 kick/8 |
end
def kc:
  | crash/8 hat/8 snare/8 hat/8 kick/8 kick/8 snare/8 hat/8 |
end
def pE:
  | [E3 B3]/1 |
end
def pA:
  | [A2 E3]/1 |
end
def pB:
  | [B2 F#3]/1 |
end
def pC:
  | [C3 G3]/1 |
end
def pG:
  | [G2 D3]/1 |
end
def pD:
  | [D3 A3]/1 |
end
def br:
  | B4/1 | | C5/1 | | D#5/1 | | E5/1 | | E5/1 | | G5/1 |
  | G5/2 E5/2 | | E5/1 |
end


; Sonja's theme, quoted from the player's ROM when the game starts (nothing of it is in this file): her hook, darkened (G# and C# lowered), on the brass
rom hook song=212 track=0 bars=7-10 transpose=0 srcshift=-12 lower=G#,C# peak=84

section I bars=4
  1: @n1 @n2 @n3 @n4
  2: @rs*4
  3: @be @ba @bb @be
  4: @kc @kb @kb @kf
  5: @rs*4
end

section A bars=8
  1: @n1 @n2 @n3 @n4 @n5 @n6 @n5 @n8
  2: @pE @pA @pB @pE @pC @pE @pC @pB
  3: @be @ba @bb @be @bc @be @bc @bb
  4: @kc @kb @kb @kf @kb @kb @kb @kf
  5: @rs*8
end

section A2 bars=8
  1: @nl @n1 @n3 @n4 @n5 @n6 @c1 @n8
  2: @pE @pE @pB @pE @pC @pE @pE @pB
  3: @be @be @bb @be @bc @be @be @bb
  4: @kc @kb @kb @kf @kb @kb @kb @kf
  5: @rs*8
end

section B bars=8
  1: @aC @aG @aD @aE @aC @aG @aB @aB
  2: @pC @pG @pD @pE @pC @pG @pB @pB
  3: @hC @hG @hD @hE @hC @hG @hB @hB
  4: @kh*3 @kf @kh*3 @kf
  5: @v1 @rom:hook

end

section A3 bars=8
  1: @n1 @n2 @n3 @n4 @n5 @n6 @c1 @c3
  2: @pE @pA @pB @pE @pC @pE @pE @pE
  3: @be @ba @bb @be @bc @be @be @be
  4: @kc @kb @kb @kf @kc @kb @kb @kf
  5: @br
end

form I loop A A2 B A3
